## Interference note
First attempt on port 9338 (profile lifecycle-ui-GvTRMY) and a second on 9353 without hiding the window received input that did not come
from this review (4 x 添加 选品工作台 then 4 x 移除 at 15:59:46–16:00:40; 1 x 添加 at 16:01:23 right after the window appeared), while the
only CDP clients were this review's launcher and agent-browser session. Most likely OS-level clicks landing in the newly focused window.
Both instances were stopped and discarded; all results above come from the hidden third instance (lifecycle-review-S2QrGn).
